      "name": "Key",
      "max": 1000,
      "default": 0,
      "explanation": "Gate and pitch. 0 = gate off; n = (n-1) x 10 cents above C0 (MIDI note 12), so MIDI note m is 10 x (m-12) + 1. Written by the keyboard controller, pitch bend included."
    },
